     A* ======================================================================
     A* ORDDSPF - Order maintenance screens
     A* Author: Arnav    Created: 2026-10-06
     A*
     A* Formats: ORDSFL/ORDCTL  = order list (load-all subfile) + search
     A*          ORDKEY         = key legend under the list (line 23)
     A*          LINSFL/LINCTL  = one order: header (control record) +
     A*                           its lines (second subfile)
     A*          LINFTR         = total + key legend under the lines
     A*          MSGSFL/MSGCTL  = message subfile on line 24
     A*
     A* Indicator map:
     A*   03 F3=Exit app  05 F5=Create  06 F6=Edit  07 F7=Delete
     A*   10 F10=Save     12 F12=Back/Cancel
     A*   31 SFLDSP 32 SFLDSPCTL 33 SFLCLR 34 SFLEND  - order list subfile
     A*   36 SFLDSP 37 SFLDSPCTL 38 SFLCLR 39 SFLEND  - order lines subfile
     A*   41 protect the header input fields (all modes except ADD)
     A*   42 protect a row's input fields (DISPLAY / DELETE) - PER ROW
     A*   43 a saved line in EDIT: Item No protected (A4), Opt open - PER ROW
     A*   44 show '(assigned on save)' instead of an order number (ADD)
     A*   51 Customer No in error
     A*   61 a row's Item No in error   62 a row's Qty in error
     A*   63 a row's Opt in error (COM0031)  - 61-63 PER ROW:
     A*      a subfile record keeps the indicators it was written/updated with
     A*   98 message subfile end marker
     A*
     A* Lines subfile: SFLSIZ 25 / SFLPAG 5 - the SYSTEM pages (Arnav's
     A* decision 2026-10-09): no 'Page X of Y', no COM0028/29. 25 rows =
     A* the max lines per order, so COM0030 can't happen.
     A* Order date: a real DATE field (*ISO), checked by the system - so
     A* COM0032 is not used (same decision as ORDINQF).
     A* Screen field names (LORDNO, HCUSTNO, DQTY...) differ from the file
     A* fields on purpose: nothing is shared, ORDPGM moves data explicitly.
     A*
     A* Change log:
     A*   2026-10-09  Arnav  Created (Sprint 4, checkpoints 4A + 4B)
     A*   2026-10-09  Arnav  Add mode: input header + lines, F10 (Sprint 5)
     A*   2026-10-13  Arnav  Edit: Opt column, hidden DOLDQTY, ind 43 / 63;
     A*                      description 28 -> 24 to make room (Sprint 6C)
     A* ======================================================================
     A                                      DSPSIZ(24 80 *DS3)
     A                                      CA03(03 'F3=Exit')
     A                                      CA12(12 'F12=Back')
     A*
     A* Order list row
     A          R ORDSFL                    SFL
     A            SEL            1A  B  7  3
     A                                      DSPATR(UL)
     A            LORDNO         7Y 0O  7  6EDTCDE(Z)
     A            LDATE         10A  O  7 15
     A            LCUSTNO        7Y 0O  7 27EDTCDE(Z)
     A            LNAME         28A  O  7 36
     A            LTOTAL        11Y 2O  7 66EDTCDE(1)
     A*
     A* Order list control: heading + Customer No search field
     A          R ORDCTL                    SFLCTL(ORDSFL)
     A                                      SFLSIZ(9999)
     A                                      SFLPAG(0010)
     A                                      OVERLAY
     A                                      CF05(05 'F5=Create')
     A                                      CF06(06 'F6=Edit')
     A                                      CF07(07 'F7=Delete')
     A  31                                  SFLDSP
     A  32                                  SFLDSPCTL
     A  33                                  SFLCLR
     A  34                                  SFLEND(*MORE)
     A                                  1  2'ORDLIST'
     A                                  1 23'ORDER MAINTENANCE - ORDER LIST'
     A                                      DSPATR(HI)
     A                                  1 72DATE EDTCDE(Y)
     A                                  2 71USER
     A                                  3  2'Customer No (blank = all):'
     A            SRCHCUST       7Y 0B  3 30EDTCDE(Z)
     A                                      DSPATR(UL)
     A                                  5  2'Type X, then Enter=Display  -
     A                                      F6=Edit  F7=Delete'
     A                                      COLOR(BLU)
     A                                  6  2'Sel'
     A                                      DSPATR(UL)
     A                                  6  6'Order No'
     A                                      DSPATR(UL)
     A                                  6 15'Date'
     A                                      DSPATR(UL)
     A                                  6 27'Cust No'
     A                                      DSPATR(UL)
     A                                  6 36'Customer Name'
     A                                      DSPATR(UL)
     A                                  6 76'Total'
     A                                      DSPATR(UL)
     A*
     A* Key legend under the list (a control record may not have
     A* fields below its subfile - CPD7812)
     A          R ORDKEY                    OVERLAY
     A                                 23  2'F3=Exit  F5=Create  F6=Edit  -
     A                                      F7=Delete  F12=Back'
     A                                      COLOR(BLU)
     A*
     A* Order line row (one per line; 25 rows in ADD / EDIT)
     A* DOLDQTY (hidden): the saved qty of a line, for the net stock change
     A* 'Protect if 42 OR 43' = ONE DSPATR(PR): a 2nd DSPATR(PR) on the same
     A* field is a duplicate keyword (CPD7518). OR = 'O' in column 7.
     A          R LINSFL                    SFL
     A            DOPT           1A  B  9  3
     A N43
     AO 42                                  DSPATR(PR)
     A  63                                  DSPATR(RI PC)
     A  43N42                               DSPATR(UL)
     A            DLINE          3Y 0O  9  6EDTCDE(Z)
     A            DITEM          7Y 0B  9 10EDTCDE(Z)
     A  42
     AO 43                                  DSPATR(PR)
     A  61                                  DSPATR(RI PC)
     A N42N43                               DSPATR(UL)
     A            DDESC         24A  O  9 18
     A            DQTY           7Y 0B  9 43EDTCDE(Z)
     A  42                                  DSPATR(PR)
     A  62                                  DSPATR(RI PC)
     A N42                                  DSPATR(UL)
     A            DPRICE         9Y 2O  9 53EDTCDE(1)
     A            DAMT          11Y 2O  9 66EDTCDE(1)
     A            DOLDQTY        7Y 0H
     A*
     A* Order header = the lines' control record (shown above them)
     A          R LINCTL                    SFLCTL(LINSFL)
     A                                      SFLSIZ(0025)
     A                                      SFLPAG(0005)
     A                                      OVERLAY
     A                                      CF10(10 'F10=Save')
     A  36                                  SFLDSP
     A  37                                  SFLDSPCTL
     A  38                                  SFLCLR
     A  39                                  SFLEND(*MORE)
     A                                  1  2'ORDDTL'
     A                                  1 28'ORDER ENTRY - COM'
     A                                      DSPATR(HI)
     A                                  1 64'Mode:'
     A            HMODE          8A  O  1 70DSPATR(HI)
     A                                  2 71USER
     A                                  3  2'Order No . . :'
     A* Same position, mutually exclusive: the number (N44) or the text (44)
     A N44        HORDNO         7Y 0O  3 17EDTCDE(Z)
     A  44                              3 17'(assigned on save)'
     A                                  3 40'Order Date . :'
     A            HORDDATE        L  B  3 55DATFMT(*ISO)
     A  41                                  DSPATR(PR)
     A N41                                  DSPATR(UL)
     A                                  4  2'Customer No  :'
     A            HCUSTNO        7Y 0B  4 17EDTCDE(Z)
     A  41                                  DSPATR(PR)
     A  51                                  DSPATR(RI PC)
     A N41                                  DSPATR(UL)
     A                                  4 40'Name . . . . :'
     A            HNAME         26A  O  4 55
     A                                  5  2'Status . . . :'
     A            HSTATUS        1A  O  5 17
     A                                  8  2'Opt'
     A                                      DSPATR(UL)
     A                                  8  6'Ln'
     A                                      DSPATR(UL)
     A                                  8 10'Item No'
     A                                      DSPATR(UL)
     A                                  8 18'Description'
     A                                      DSPATR(UL)
     A                                  8 47'Qty'
     A                                      DSPATR(UL)
     A                                  8 59'Price'
     A                                      DSPATR(UL)
     A                                  8 74'Amount'
     A                                      DSPATR(UL)
     A*
     A* Total + mode-dependent key legend (own record, CPD7812)
     A          R LINFTR                    OVERLAY
     A                                 16 50'Total Amount:'
     A            HTOTAL        11Y 2O 16 66EDTCDE(1)
     A                                      DSPATR(HI)
     A            LEGEND        78A  O 23  2COLOR(BLU)
     A*
     A* Message subfile - same as the other display files
     A          R MSGSFL                    SFL
     A                                      SFLMSGRCD(24)
     A            MSGKEY                    SFLMSGKEY
     A            PGMQ                      SFLPGMQ(10)
     A          R MSGCTL                    SFLCTL(MSGSFL)
     A                                      OVERLAY
     A                                      SFLDSP
     A                                      SFLDSPCTL
     A                                      SFLINZ
     A  98                                  SFLEND
     A                                      SFLSIZ(0002)
     A                                      SFLPAG(0001)
     A            PGMQ                      SFLPGMQ(10)
